{"id":"ee6e992ddf35c1d4","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-np-and-verifier-notation.md","title":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation","display":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","display":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","[[73-df-p-notation]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]"],"aliases":["73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","73-definition-10.4"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation — np and verifier notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"533df2318af82f63\" href=\"?note=533df2318af82f63\" title=\"73-df-p-notation\">73-df-p-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-np-and-verifier-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.4</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{NTIME}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P\">\\(\\mathrm P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"533df2318af82f63\" href=\"?note=533df2318af82f63\" title=\"73-df-p-notation\">73-df-p-notation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 使用固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> 的二进制配对；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathrm P\">\\(V\\in\\mathrm P\\)</span> 是语言而非机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\">\\(V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\)</span> 由下式解释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span> 为有有限多个自然数系数的多项式函数集合，由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^m\">\\(\\mathbf2^m\\)</span> 是长度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的词集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto n^k),\\qquad\n\\mathbb N[n]\\coloneqq\\{p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_0,\\ldots,a_d)\\in\\mathbb N^{d+1}\\;\\forall n\\;p(n)=\\sum_{i=0}^d a_in^i\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{NTIME}(n\\mapsto n^k),\\qquad\n\\mathbb N[n]\\coloneqq\\{p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_0,\\ldots,a_d)\\in\\mathbb N^{d+1}\\;\\forall n\\;p(n)=\\sum_{i=0}^d a_in^i\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nV(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nV(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二种刻画仍使用恰好 p(|x|) 位见证；较短见证可通过带长度标记的填充归入此形式。V∈P 作为验证关系的配对语言解释，避免把复杂度类中的语言当成机器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-p-notation","status":"resolved","id":"533df2318af82f63","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-p-notation]]","e