le x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\in V","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.4}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\leftrightarrow\\exists V\\in\\mathrm P\\;\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbf2^{p(|x|)}\\;V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts})","display":true}],"bytes":1779,"backlinks":[{"id":"d7e06494e0db8c00","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$，$\\mathrm{NP}$ 见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]；$\\overline L$ 的全集明确为 $\\mathbf2^*$。"},{"id":"6843fe402485436b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NP}$、$\\leq_p$ 分别见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-polynomial-reduction-notation]]；集合载体均为 $\\mathbf2^*$。"},{"id":"e452239d1f453972","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{PSPACE},\\mathrm{EXPTIME}$ 分别见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-pspace-notation]]、[[73-df-exptime-notation]]；全部采用二进制词语言载体。"},{"id":"643ca49e5f5f7846","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,L'\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$；$\\mathrm{NP},\\leq_p,\\mathrm{NPC}$ 见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-polynomial-reduction-notation]]、[[73-df-np-completeness-notation]]。"},{"id":"e23c2f09d27abd49","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{NPC}$ 见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-np-completeness-notation]]。"}],"outgoing":["995085b8741b47ae","533df2318af82f63","db96cabedd089e5f"]}